:change_language_cn_notnow\">\n              关闭\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"c-lang-switch__list\">\n              <div class=\"c-lang-switch__item\">\n                <div class=\"c-lang-switch__icon-img-box\"></div>\n                <p class=\"c-lang-switch__text\">\n                  浏览器的首选语言设置为简体中文。\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"c-lang-switch__text\">\n                  更改页面的显示语言以便帮助您更舒适地使用Tabelog。\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"c-lang-switch__install-box\">\n              <a class=\"c-btn c-lang-switch__btn js-inbound-link js-analytics-lang-switch\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_cn_change\" href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/\">切换到简体中文</a>\n              <p class=\"c-lang-switch__more js-lang-change-close js-analytics-lang-switch js-lang-change-notnow-cn\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_cn_notnow\">\n                继续使用英语\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"c-lang-switch__inner js-lang-change-text-tw\">\n            <p class=\"c-modal__close c-lang-switch__close js-lang-change-close js-analytics-lang-switch js-lang-change-notnow-tw\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_tw_notnow\">\n              關閉\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"c-lang-switch__list\">\n              <div class=\"c-lang-switch__item\">\n                <div class=\"c-lang-switch__icon-img-box\"></div>\n                <p class=\"c-lang-switch__text\">\n                  瀏覽器的首選語言設定為繁體中文。\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"c-lang-switch__text\">\n                  更改頁面的顯示語言可以讓您更舒適地使用Tabelog。\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"c-lang-switch__install-box\">\n              <a class=\"c-btn c-lang-switch__btn js-inbound-link js-analytics-lang-switch\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_tw_change\" href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/\">切換到繁體中文</a>\n              <p class=\"c-lang-switch__more js-lang-change-close js-analytics-lang-switch js-lang-change-notnow-tw\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_tw_notnow\">\n                繼續使用英文\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"c-lang-switch__inner js-lang-change-text-kr\">\n            <p class=\"c-modal__close c-lang-switch__close js-lang-change-close js-analytics-lang-switch js-lang-change-notnow-kr\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_kr_notnow\">\n              닫기\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"c-lang-switch__list\">\n              <div class=\"c-lang-switch__item\">\n                <div class=\"c-lang-switch__icon-img-box\"></div>\n                <p class=\"c-lang-switch__text\">\n                  브라우저의 기본 언어가 한국어로 설정되어 있습니다.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"c-lang-switch__text\">\n                  페이지의 표시 언어를 변경하면 Tabelog를 더 편리하게 이용할 수 있습니다.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"c-lang-switch__install-box\">\n              <a class=\"c-btn c-lang-switch__btn js-inbound-link js-analytics-lang-switch\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_kr_change\" href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/\">한국어로 변경</a>\n              <p class=\"c-lang-switch__more js-lang-change-close js-analytics-lang-switch js-lang-change-notnow-kr\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_kr_notnow\">\n                영어로 계속하기\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"c-lang-switch__inner js-lang-change-text-th\">\n            <p class=\"c-modal__close c-lang-switch__close js-lang-change-close js-analytics-lang-switch js-lang-change-notnow-th\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_th_notnow\">\n              ปิด\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"c-lang-switch__list\">\n              <div class=\"c-lang-switch__item\">\n                <div class=\"c-lang-switch__icon-img-box\"></div>\n                <p class=\"c-lang-switch__text\">\n                  เบราว์เซอร์ของคุณตั้งค่าภาษาที่ต้องการเป็นภาษาไทย\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"c-lang-switch__text\">\n                  ใช้ฟังก์ชันรองรับหลายภาษาของ Tabelog เพื่อประสบการณ์การใช้งานที่ดีที่สุด\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"c-lang-switch__install-box\">\n              <a class=\"c-btn c-lang-switch__btn js-inbound-link js-analytics-lang-switch\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_th_change\" href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/\">เปลี่ยนเป็นภาษาไทย</a>\n              <p class=\"c-lang-switch__more js-lang-change-close js-analytics-lang-switch js-lang-change-notnow-th\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_th_notnow\">\n                ดำเนินการต่อเป็นภาษาอังกฤษ\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flexible-rstlst-footer\">\n      <footer class=\"l-footer inbound-global-footer js-footer-stopper\">\n        <div class=\"inbound-global-footer__webtoapp inbound-global-footer__webtoapp--list\">\n          <a class=\"js-analytics inbound-global-footer__webtoapp-inner\" data-analytics-add-page-prefix=\"true\" data-analytics-btn=\":app_footer_install\" data-google-interstitial=\"false\">\n            <div class=\"inbound-global-footer__webtoapp-heading\">\n              <img width=\"1040\" height=\"540\" class=\"inbound-global-footer__webtoapp-heading-img\" alt=\"The most downloaded restaurant search app in Japan for international travelers\" />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"inbound-global-footer__webtoapp-install\">\n              <div class=\"inbound-global-footer__webtoapp-install-btn\">\n                Install Tabelog Multilingual App\n              </div>\n              <img width=\"133\" height=\"133\" class=\"inbound-global-footer__webtoapp-qr\" alt=\"Tabelog App QR Code\" />\n            </div>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"inbound