                <li class=\"p-main-photos__switch-photo js-switch-image-item\" data-slide-index=\"2\">\n                    <a class=\"p-main-photos__switch-photo-target\" href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/A132202/13155817/\"><img alt=\"Kushi Katsu Tanaka Nishiikebukuro ten\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" /></a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"p-main-photos__switch-photo js-switch-image-item\" data-slide-index=\"3\">\n                    <a class=\"p-main-photos__switch-photo-target\" href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/A132202/13155817/\"><img alt=\"Kushi Katsu Tanaka Nishiikebukuro ten\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" /></a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"p-main-photos__switch-photo js-switch-image-item\" data-slide-index=\"4\">\n                    <a class=\"p-main-photos__switch-photo-target\" href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/A132202/13155817/\"><img alt=\"Kushi Katsu Tanaka Nishiikebukuro ten\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" /></a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"p-main-photos__switch-photo js-switch-image-item\" data-slide-index=\"5\">\n                    <a class=\"p-main-photos__switch-photo-target\" href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/A132202/13155817/\"><img alt=\"Kushi Katsu Tanaka Nishiikebukuro ten\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" /></a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"p-main-photos__switch-photo js-switch-image-item\" data-slide-index=\"6\">\n                    <a class=\"p-main-photos__switch-photo-target\" href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/A132202/13155817/\"><img alt=\"Kushi Katsu Tanaka Nishiikebukuro ten\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" /></a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"p-main-photos__switch-photo js-switch-image-item\" data-slide-index=\"7\">\n                    <a class=\"p-main-photos__switch-photo-target\" href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/A132202/13155817/\"><img alt=\"Kushi Katsu Tanaka Nishiikebukuro ten\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" /></a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"p-main-photos__switch-photo js-switch-image-item\" data-slide-index=\"8\">\n                    <a class=\"p-main-photos__switch-photo-target\" href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/A132202/13155817/\"><img alt=\"Kushi Katsu Tanaka Nishiikebukuro ten\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" /></a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"p-main-photos__switch-photo js-switch-image-item\" data-slide-index=\"9\">\n                    <a class=\"p-main-photos__switch-photo-target\" href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/A132202/13155817/\"><img alt=\"Kushi Katsu Tanaka Nishiikebukuro ten\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" /></a>\n                  </li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pr-comment-wrap\">\n              <h3 class=\"pr-comment-title js-pr-title\">\n                Proudly serving Osaka&#39;s traditional Kushi-katsu and affordable drinks! Families with children and adult gatherings are all warmly welcomed!\n              </h3>\n              <div class=\"pr-comment\">\n                <p class=\"pr-comment__body js-pr-comment-body is-hidden\">\n                  <span class=\"pr-comment__option\"><span class=\"pr-comment__first\">Enjoy the vibrant atmosphere and traditional flavors of Osaka at Kushikatsu Tanaka! Bite into crispy, hot kushikatsu dipped generously in our secret sauce for an authentic taste of Osaka! At Kushikats<span class=\"js-pr-comment-more pr-comment__more-icon is-hidden\">...</span><button class=\"pr-comment__more js-pr-comment-more is-hidden\" type=\"button\">Read more</button><span class=\"pr-comment__over js-pr-comment-over\">u Tanaka, don’t miss out on &quot;Chinchiro&quot;! If you&#39;re lucky, you might win a free drink, and even if you don’t, you can still toast with a mega cup! Making your own takoyaki is sure to be a hit too! With affordable prices, you can raise a glass every day! <br />We also offer great services for kids, making it a family-friendly spot. Experience Kushikatsu Tanaka, where both adults and children can have a fantastic time!<br /></span></span></span>\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari\">\n              <div class=\"rstdtl-heading\">\n                <h3 class=\"rstdtl-heading__title\">\n                  Specialities\n                </h3>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__item\">\n                <div class=\"js-kodawari-cassete rstdtl-top-kodawari__target\" data-kodawari-id=\"1\">\n                  <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__contents\">\n                    <p class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__label rstdtl-top-kodawari__label--food\">\n                      Food \n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__photo\"><img alt=\"Is it the thrill of spices or the shock of garlic? Which one do you prefer?\" />\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__title\">\n                      Is it the thrill of spices or the shock of garlic? Which one do you prefer?\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"js-kodawari-cassete rstdtl-top-kodawari__target\" data-kodawari-id=\"2\">\n                  <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__contents\">\n                    <p class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__label rstdtl-top-kodawari__label--drink\">\n                      Drink\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__photo\"><img alt=\"Unbelievable Price! &quot;Unlimited Highball&quot; for just JPY 110 (Tax Included) anytime!\" />\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__title\">\n                      Unbelievable Price! &quot;Unlimited Highball&quot; for just JPY 110 (Tax Included) anytime!\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"js-kodawari-cassete rstdtl-top-kodawari__target\" data-kodawari-id=\"3\">\n                  <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__contents\">\n                    <p class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__label rstdtl-top-kodawari__label--service\">\n                      Service\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__photo\"><img alt=\"[Family-Friendly] Enjoy Takoyaki and Ice Cream on Us! Great Perks Await!\" />\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__title\">\n                      [Family-Friendly] Enjoy Takoyaki and Ice Cream on Us! Great Perks Await!\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"js-kodawari-cassete rstdtl-top-kodawari__target\" data-kodawari-id=\"4\">\n                  <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__contents\">\n                    <p class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__label rstdtl-top-kodawari__label--food\">\n                      Food \n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__photo\"><img alt=\"Banquet Course with 120-Minute All-You-Can-Drink for JPY 4,000 (Tax Included) ~\" />\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__title\">\n                      Banquet Course with 120-Minute All-You-Can-Drink for JPY 4,000 (Tax Included) ~\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"rstdtl-top-course\">\n              <div class=\"rstdtl-heading rstdtl-top-course__heading\">\n                <h3 class=\"rstdtl-heading__title\">\n                  Set menu\n                </h3>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"rstdtl-course-list js-rstdtl-course-list\">\n                <div class=\"rstdtl-course-list__inner\">\n                  <p class=\"rstdtl-course-list__img\"><a class=\"rstdtl-course-list__img-target\" href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/A132202/13155817/party/298846541/\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"120\" width=\"120\" /></a>\n                  </p>\n                  <div class=\"rstdtl-course-list__data\">\n                    <div class=\"rstdtl-course-list__data-header\">\n                      <div class=\"rstdtl-course-list__course-summary\">\n                        <div class=\"rstdtl-course-list__option\">\n                          <span class=\"c-label c-label--s rstdtl-course-list__label rstdtl-course-list__label--emphasis\">All you can drink</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"rstdtl-course-list__course-title\"><a class=\"rstdtl-course-list__target\" href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/A132202/13155817/party/298846541/\">\n                                      <span class=\"rstdtl-course-list__course-title-text\">Kushikatsu Tanaka Course, 13 Dishes, 120 Minutes All-You-Can-Drink, JPY 4,400 (Tax Included)</span></a><span class=\"c-label c-label--s rstdtl-course-list__label\">13 items</span>\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"rstdtl-course-list__desc\">\n                          Enjoy six varieties of Kushi Katsu! Additionally, you can savor Kushi Katsu Tanaka&#39;s specialties such as &quot;Kasu Udon&quot; and &quot;Potato Salad.&quot; This course is packed with value and includes a two-hour all-you-can-drink option! \n                          *The photo represents a serving for four people.\n                        </p>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"rstdtl-course-list__action-btn\">\n                        <span class=\"c-btn c-btn--s c-btn--primary rstdtl-course-list__action-btn-target js-show-yoyaku-modal-trigger-course\" data-catalog-price=\"\" data-course-name=\"Kushikatsu Tanaka Course, 13 Dishes, 120 Minutes All-You-Can-Drink, JPY 4,400 (Tax Included