            "mimeType": "text/html",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <title>Kushi Katsu Tanaka Nishisugamo ten Reservation - Nishi Sugamo/Kushi-age (Deep-fried skewers) | Tabelog</title>\n    <meta content=\"Check out Kushi Katsu Tanaka Nishisugamo ten (Nishi Sugamo/Kushi-age (Deep-fried skewers)、Izakaya (Japanese style tavern)、Udon (Wheat noodles)) on Tabelog! Proudly serving Osaka&#39;s traditional Kushi Katsu and affordable drinks! Families with children and adult gatherings are all warmly welcomed! [No Smoking / All-you-can-drink / Online reservations] Discover Japanese restaurants featuring detailed information such as menus and maps, along with user-posted reviews, ratings, and photos!\" name=\"description\" />\n    <link media=\"only screen and (max-width: 640px)\" rel=\"alternate\" />\n    <meta content=\"ie=edge\" http-equiv=\"x-ua-compatible\" />\n    <meta content=\"width=1000\" name=\"viewport\" />\n    <meta content=\"telephone=no\" name=\"format-detection\" />\n    \n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"all\" href=\"https://tblg.k-img.com/stylesheets/css/inbound/desktop/application.css?rst-v1-202611021942-86cebb7e3b9fb564dbb294f2f68e9421e64453e28f8afd11f00b2adfaa402df0\" /><link rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"all\" href=\"https://tblg.k-img.com/stylesheets/css/inbound/desktop/rstdtl/rstdtl_calendar.css?rst-v1-202611021942-49303cb3275832d9df95353fda32b8e0b4c90a66edff7a284ff5304f3705d468\" /><link rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"all\" href=\"https://tblg.k-img.com/stylesheets/lib/jquery-ui-1.12.1.smoothness.custom.min.css?rst-v1-202611021942-c5c60f20207a5470c978a2855615ae604b3b20f88b7a4841de1711c46339e78d\" />\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"all\" href=\"https://tblg.k-img.com/stylesheets/lib/colorbox.css?rst-v1-202611021942-f4cec0ed48e7e3432e067401c68ea1a23d8b239c132f3ab90e4e940e24efb1ee\" /><link rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"screen\" href=\"https://tblg.k-img.com/stylesheets/lib/jquery.mCustomScrollbar-3.1.5.css?rst-v1-202