tration status, please check the National Tax Agency&#39;s Qualified Invoice Issuer Publication Site or contact the restaurant.\n                      </p>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <th>\n                      Service charge &amp; fee\n                    </th>\n                    <td>\n                      <p>\n                        Appetizer fee: 319 yen (including tax)\n                      </p>\n                      <p class=\"rstinfo-table__original-text-label\">\n                        Original text\n                      </p>\n                      <p class=\"rstinfo-table__original-text\">\n                        お通し代 319円(税込)\n                      </p>\n                      <p class=\"rstinfo-table__original-text-notice\">\n                        This section has been automatically translated. Please check with the restaurant for accurate information.\n                      </p>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                </tbody>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"rstinfo-table__title\">\n              Seats/facilities \n            </h4>\n            <table class=\"c-table c-table--form rstinfo-table__table\">\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <th>\n                    Number of seats\n                  </th>\n                  <td>\n                    <p>\n                      54 seats\n                    </p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <th>\n                    Private rooms\n                  </th>\n                  <td>\n                    <p>\n                      Unavailable\n                    </p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <th>\n                    Private use\n                  </th>\n                  <td>\n                    <p>\n                