        <h4 class=\"rstinfo-table__title\">\n              Feature  - Related information \n            </h4>\n            <table class=\"c-table c-table--form rstinfo-table__table\">\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <th>\n                    Occasion\n                  </th>\n                  <td>\n                    <p><a>Family friendly </a>\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"rstinfo-table__notice\">\n                      This occasion is recommended by many people.\n                    </p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <th>\n                  Service\n                </th>\n                <td>\n                  <p>\n                    Pet friendly (Good for pets), Take-out, Delivery, Multilingual menu available（English）\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <th>\n                  Family friendly\n                </th>\n                <td>\n                  <p>\n                    Children welcome(Babies welcome, Preschoolers welcome, School-age children welcome), Kids menu available, Strollers welcome\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <th>\n                  Website\n                </th>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"homepage\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"c-link-arrow\">\n                            <span>https://kushi-tanaka.com/restaurant/detail/nishisugamo</span></a>\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <th>\n                  The opening day\n                </th>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"rstinfo-opened-date\">\n                    2019.9.27\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <th>\n                  Phone number\n                </th>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"rstinfo-table__tel-num-wrap\">\n                    <strong class=\"rstinfo-table__tel-num\">[REDACTED]</strong>\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <th>\n                  Remarks\n                </th>\n                <td>\n                  <p class=\"rstinfo-remarks-item\">\n                    Instructions for Customers Bringing Dogs<br>1. Please ensure your dog is wearing clothes at all times (to prevent shedding and dander).<br>2. Bringing snacks is allowed.<br>3. Please refrain from bringing your own meals.<br>4. Do not feed your dog any food provided by the restaurant (including cabbage) or use any items meant for human use, such as plates.<br>5. We kindly ask that you do not bring pets in heat (during their menstrual cycle).<br>6. Please use leashes or carriers to prevent your dog from wandering around the store.<br>7. You may bring a maximum of 2 dogs per person.<br>Even if you do not fall under the above categories, we may refuse entry based on the staff's judgment on the day. Thank you for your understanding and cooperation in creating a pleasant environment for everyone.\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n            <div class=\"rdheader-notice rstdtl-wovn-notice\">\n              This page has been automatically translated. Please note that some translations may be inaccurate.\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"rstinfo-actions\">\n              <div class=\"rstinfo-actions__btn-wrap\">\n                <p class=\"rstinfo-actions__btn\">\n                  <a class=\"c-btn c-btn--full gly-b-mail rstinfo-actions__btn-target rstinfo-actions__btn-target--mobile-send js-catalyst-rstinfo-mobile-send\">Send information by email</a>\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"