                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__item\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/C13116/rstLst/kushiage/\">Toshima City × Kushi-age (Deep-fried skewers)</a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__item\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/C13116/rstLst/izakaya/\">Toshima City × Izakaya (Japanese style tavern)</a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__item\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/C13116/rstLst/udon/\">Toshima City × Udon (Wheat noodles)</a>\n                  </li>\n                </ul>\n                <h4 class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__title\">\n                  Categories\n                </h4>\n                <ul class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__list\">\n                  <li class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__item\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/rstLst/kushiage/\">Kushi-age (Deep-fried skewers)</a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__item\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/rstLst/izakaya/\">Izakaya (Japanese style tavern)</a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__item\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/rstLst/udon/\">Udon (Wheat noodles)</a>\n                  </li>\n                </ul>\n              </section>\n              <section class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents\">\n                <h4 class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__title\">\n                  Rankings in nearby areas\n                </h4>\n                <ul class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__list\">\n                  <li class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__item\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/rstLst/lunch/\">Lunch rankings in Tokyo</a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__item\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/rstLst/lunch/\">Lunch rankings in Itabashi, Along Tobu Railway Line</a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__item\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/A132201/rstLst/lunch/\">Lunch rankings in Kita-Ikebukuro, Itabashi St. Area</a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__item\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/A132201/R7446/rstLst/lunch/\">Lunch rankings in Nishi Sugamo Sta.</a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__item\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/rank/\">Kushi-age (Deep-fried skewers) Top-Rated Restaurants in Tokyo</a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__item\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/rank/\">Kushi-age (Deep-fried skewers) Top-Rated Restaurants in Itabashi, Along Tobu Railway Line</a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__item\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/A132201/rank/\">Kushi-age (Deep-fried skewers) Top-Rated Restaurants in Kita-Ikebukuro, Itabashi St. Area</a>\n                  </li>\n                  <li class=\"rstdtl-relation-contents__item\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/rank/\">Top-Rated Restaurants in Tokyo</a>\n                  </li>\n                </ul>\n              </section>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"layout1-side\" id=\"column-side\">\n            <div class=\"rstdtl-side-yoyaku rstdtl-sidebar js-floating-rstdtl-sidebar\">\n              <div class=\"rstdtl-sidebar__position js-rstdtl-sidebar-position\">\n                <div class=\"rstdtl-sidebar__floating-wrap\">\n                  <div class=\"rstdtl-sidebar__wrap js-rstdtl-sidebar-wrap\">\n                    <div class=\"rstdtl-side-yoyaku__action\">\n                      <div class=\"rstdtl-side-yoyaku__tel-wrap\">\n                        <div class=\"rstdtl-side-yoyaku__tel js-tel-call-available is-hidden\">\n                          <p class=\"rstdtl-side-yoyaku__tel-number\">\n                            [REDACTED]\n                          </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"rstdtl-side-yoyaku__tel-off-hours js-tel-call-unavailable is-hidden\">\n                          <div class=\"rstdtl-side-yoyaku__tel-off-hours-title\">\n                            Phone lines are currently closed.\n                          </div>\n                          <p class=\"rstdtl-side-yoyaku__tel-off-hours-message\">\n                            *Please make your reservations online.\n                          </p>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"rstdtl-side-yoyaku__infosend-wrap\">\n                        <div class=\"rstdtl-side-yoyaku__infosend\" id=\"js-send-button\">\n                          <a class=\"infosend__action-btn\">Send (by email)</a>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"rstdtl-side-yoyaku__booking js-rstdtl-side-yoyaku__reserve\">\n                      <div class=\"rstdtl-side-yoyaku__booking-head\">\n                        <h3 class=\"rstdtl-side-yoyaku__booking-title\">\n                          Online reservation\n                        </h3>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"rstdtl-side-yoyaku__calendar-wrap\">\n                        <div class=\"js-side-calendar-wrapper rstdtl-side-yoyaku__calendar\"></div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div data-key=\"from_yoyaku\" data-value=\"1\" id=\"js-yoyaku-calendar-modal-open-by-parameter\"></div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <script id=\"js-tmpl-overlay\" type=\"text/x-handlebars-template\">\n        <div class=\"c-overlay js-modal-overlay-clickarea\">\n        </div>\n      </script>\n      \n      <script id=\"js-tmpl-loader\" type=\"text/x-handlebars-template\">\n        <div class=\"c-overlay__loader\">\n          <div class=\"c-loader c-loader--inverse\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </script>\n      <div class=\"c-modal rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal js-kodawari-detail-modal is-hidden\">\n        <p class=\"c-modal__close js-modal-close\">\n          閉じる\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"c-modal__contents rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-contents js-kodawari-contents js-kodawari-1\">\n          <div class=\"c-modal__inner rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-contents-inner\"><button name=\"button\" type=\"submit\" class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-target rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-target--prev is-disabled\" data-other-kodawari=\"0\">\n                  <i>前へ</i></button>\n            <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-photo\"><img width=\"320\" height=\"320\" alt=\"Is it the thrill of spices or the shock of garlic? Which one do you prefer?\" />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-textbox\">\n              <p class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-title-wrap\">\n                <span class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-label rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-label--food\">Food </span><span class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-title\">Is it the thrill of spices or the shock of garlic? Which one do you prefer?</span>\n              </p>\n              <p class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-comment\">\n                Get ready for the upgraded &quot;Unlimited Garlic Horumon Skewers&quot;! Experience an even stronger punch of garlic and an addictive flavor that will blow your mind! The &quot;Unlimited Spicy Horumon Skewers&quot; feature a special spice blend of multiple herbs and spices in a perfect ratio, delivering a bold and zesty taste! Both unlimited skewers pair perfectly with drinks, and the price remains the same at just JPY 50 (tax included JPY 55) each!\n              </p>\n            </div><button name=\"button\" type=\"submit\" class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-target rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-target--next js-kodawari-modal-change\" data-other-kodawari=\"2\">\n                  <i>次へ</i></button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"c-modal__contents rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-contents js-kodawari-contents js-kodawari-2\">\n          <div class=\"c-modal__inner rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-contents-inner\"><button name=\"button\" type=\"submit\" class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-target rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-target--prev js-kodawari-modal-change\" data-other-kodawari=\"1\">\n                  <i>前へ</i></button>\n            <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-photo\"><img width=\"320\" height=\"320\" alt=\"Unbelievable Price! &quot;Unlimited Highball&quot; Always Just JPY 110 (Tax Included)!\" />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-textbox\">\n              <p class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-title-wrap\">\n                <span class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-label rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-label--drink\">Drink</span><span class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-title\">Unbelievable Price! &quot;Unlimited Highball&quot; Always Just JPY 110 (Tax Included)!</span>\n              </p>\n              <p class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-comment\">\n                Unbeatable value! Our &quot;Infinite Highball&quot; pairs perfectly with skewered cutlets and is just JPY 110 (tax included) for a glass anytime! Don&#39;t miss out on our &quot;Infinite Skewers&quot; at JPY 55 (tax included) and the special sour drink designed to complement them for JPY 319 (tax included)! \n                We offer two refreshing options: the dry &quot;Tsundere&quot; with strong carbonation and a zesty lemon-lime flavor to cleanse your palate, and the gentle &quot;Yorisoi&quot; that enhances the taste of the skewers with its sweet and sour notes of plum and grapefruit. \n                Come enjoy this ultimate pairing that you can only experience here tonight!\n              </p>\n            </div><button name=\"button\" type=\"submit\" class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-target rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-target--next js-kodawari-modal-change\" data-other-kodawari=\"3\">\n                  <i>次へ</i></button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"c-modal__contents rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-contents js-kodawari-contents js-kodawari-3\">\n          <div class=\"c-modal__inner rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-contents-inner\"><button name=\"button\" type=\"submit\" class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-target rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-target--prev js-kodawari-modal-change\" data-other-kodawari=\"2\">\n                  <i>前へ</i></button>\n            <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-photo\"><img width=\"320\" height=\"320\" alt=\"[Family-Friendly] Enjoy Takoyaki and Ice Cream on Us! Great Perks Await!\" />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-textbox\">\n              <p class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-title-wrap\">\n                <span class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-label rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-label--service\">Service</span><span class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-title\">[Family-Friendly] Enjoy Takoyaki and Ice Cream on Us! Great Perks Await!</span>\n              </p>\n              <p class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-comment\">\n                We warmly welcome families with children under elementary school age! Enjoy our free perks that everyone in the family can have fun with. \n                1. A fun &quot;Takoyaki Set (9 pieces)&quot; is free for one group of children under elementary school age! \n                2. Win a game of &quot;Rock-Paper-Scissors&quot; against our staff to get a free soft drink (tie gets half off) - available for those under 19. \n                3. After your meal, kids under elementary school age can enjoy a complimentary &quot;Make-Your-Own Soft Serve Ice Cream&quot;! \n                Feel free to use our restaurant for family dinners or mom gatherings. (Note: Some services may not be available at all locations.)\n              </p>\n            </div><button name=\"button\" type=\"submit\" class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-target rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-target--next js-kodawari-modal-change\" data-other-kodawari=\"4\">\n                  <i>次へ</i></button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"c-modal__contents rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-contents js-kodawari-contents js-kodawari-4\">\n          <div class=\"c-modal__inner rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-contents-inner\"><button name=\"button\" type=\"submit\" class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-target rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-target--prev js-kodawari-modal-change\" data-other-kodawari=\"3\">\n                  <i>前へ</i></button>\n            <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-photo\"><img width=\"320\" height=\"320\" alt=\"Banquet Course with 120-Minute All-You-Can-Drink for JPY 4,000 (Tax Included) ~\" />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-textbox\">\n              <p class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-title-wrap\">\n                <span class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-label rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-label--food\">Food </span><span class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-title\">Banquet Course with 120-Minute All-You-Can-Drink for JPY 4,000 (Tax Included) ~</span>\n              </p>\n              <p class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-comment\">\n                Of course, you can enjoy our signature dishes like Kushi Katsu and Saiboshi! You can also have fun making your own hot Takoyaki with our course options. With a 2-hour all-you-can-drink plan, it&#39;s a hearty and satisfying experience!\n              </p>\n            </div><button name=\"button\" type=\"submit\" class=\"rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-target rstdtl-top-kodawari__modal-target--next is-disabled\" data-other-kodawari=\"5\">\n                  <i>次へ</i></button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"js-detail-photo-modal\" data-target-url=\"https://tabelog.com/en/inbound_restaurant_detail_image_preview_api/show\"></div><div class=\"c-overlay is-hidden js-lang-change-section-overlay\">\n        <div class=\"c-modal c-lang-switch is-hidden js-lang-change-section\">\n          <div class=\"c-lang-switch__inner js-lang-change-text-en\">\n            <p class=\"c-modal__close c-lang-switch__close js-lang-change-close js-analytics-lang-switch js-lang-change-notnow-en\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_en_notnow\">\n              Close\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"c-lang-switch__list\">\n              <div class=\"c-lang-switch__item\">\n                <div class=\"c-lang-switch__icon-img-box\"></div>\n                <p class=\"c-lang-switch__text\">\n                  Your browser&#39;s preferred language is set to English.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"c-lang-switch__text\">\n                  Take advantage of Tabelog&#39;s multilingual support for the best user experience.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"c-lang-switch__install-box\">\n              <a class=\"c-btn c-lang-switch__btn js-inbound-link js-analytics-lang-switch\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_en_change\" href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/A132201/13239336/\">Switch to English</a>\n              <p class=\"c-lang-switch__more js-lang-change-close js-analytics-lang-switch js-lang-change-notnow-en\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_en_notnow\">\n                translation missing: en.g.language_switch.continue_in.en\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"c-lang-switch__inner js-lang-change-text-cn\">\n            <p class=\"c-modal__close c-lang-switch__close js-lang-change-close js-analytics-lang-switch js-lang-change-notnow-cn\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_cn_notnow\">\n              关闭\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"c-lang-switch__list\">\n              <div class=\"c-lang-switch__item\">\n                <div class=\"c-lang-switch__icon-img-box\"></div>\n                <p class=\"c-lang-switch__text\">\n                  浏览器的首选语言设置为简体中文。\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"c-lang-switch__text\">\n                  更改页面的显示语言以便帮助您更舒适地使用Tabelog。\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"c-lang-switch__install-box\">\n              <a class=\"c-btn c-lang-switch__btn js-inbound-link js-analytics-lang-switch\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_cn_change\" href=\"https://tabelog.com/en/tokyo/A1322/A132201/13239336/\">切换到简体中文</a>\n              <p class=\"c-lang-switch__more js-lang-change-close js-analytics-lang-switch js-lang-change-notnow-cn\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_cn_notnow\">\n                继续使用英语\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"c-lang-switch__inner js-lang-change-text-tw\">\n            <p class=\"c-modal__close c-lang-switch__close js-lang-change-close js-analytics-lang-switch js-lang-change-notnow-tw\" data-analytics-btn=\":change_language_tw_notnow\">\n              關閉\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"c-lang-switch__list\">\n              <div class=\"c-lang-switch__item\">\n                <div class=\"c-lang-switch__icon-img-box\"></div>\n                <p class=\"c-lang-switch__text\">\n                  瀏覽器的首選語言設定為繁體中文。\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"c-lang-switch__text\">\n                  更改頁面的顯示語